   "in_delta": true,
   "line": 11,
   "message": "The figcaption describes only three of the video's beats: the commit, the drafted time and the PM's approval. The captions file (00:23\u201300:29, \"Deployments move releases\") and the 062 mock storyboard (23\u201329 s) also show a release moving from UAT to Prod, and the caption leaves it out. The mock's caption text (\"Kasun pushes a commit\u2026\") also differs from the shipped VTT (\"You push a commit.\"). Fix: add the release beat to the figcaption and make the mock text match the VTT.",
   "original_severity": "minor",
   "pass": "review",
